  /// commission is deducted entirely from the professional's payout, never
  /// charged to the customer on top. Kept in the enum only so historical
  /// rows recorded before Module 64 remain readable.
  CUSTOMER_PLATFORM_FEE
  /// The professional's/company's payout after MaestroYa's commission is
