/// review steps toward a decision. `MANUAL` (the default) is the entire
/// pre-Module-59 Module 17 workflow, unchanged: a professional uploads
/// documents and an ADMIN/SUPER_ADMIN reviews them by hand. `PERSONA`
/// means the case is (also) linked to an automated Persona inquiry —
/// `providerVerificationId`/`providerStatus`/`providerSyncedAt` below are
